data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","output":"The day-02 optimization probe has been created successfully. Here's the summary:\n\n---\n\n## ✅ File Created\n**`shared/self_evolution_2026-05-26_day-02_optimization_probe.md`** — 678 lines, 43,445 bytes\n\n## Key Findings\n\n### Persistent State (Unchanged from Day-01)\n| Metric | Status |\n|--------|--------|\n| Skills scoring 0/6 on T1–T6 | **32 of 32 (100%)** — same ratio, +6 more skills |\n| Missing metrics M1–M10 populated | **0 of 10** — zero infrastructure deployed |\n| Contract C1 (non-null `completedSummary`) | **Still unfilled** — 30+ runs, 2 full daily cycles |\n| Telemetry files (`_usage.json`, `.registry.json`, `*.sse`) | **0 files across all patterns** |\n\n### NEW Day-02 Observations\n| Observation | Value |\n|-------------|-------|\n| Template duplication ratio | **87.5% (28/32)** — first formal measurement |\n| Mirroring bijection integrity | **82% (9/11)** — 2 source skills missing projections |\n| Creation:activation ratio | **32:0** — supply-demand imbalance |\n| Precipitation score | **18.4/100** (down from 19.3) — ratio erosion trend |\n| Skill growth rate | **+6/cycle** — skill production accelerating |\n\n### Decision\n**GOVERNED NO-CHANGE (continued deferral)** — same as day-01. All 5 potential optimizations (3 from day-01 + 2 new) remain blocked by absent telemetry substrate. No metrics have been populated since day-01.\n\n### Probe Procedure Expanded\nFrom 4 phases (day-01) to **7 phases**:\n- **Phase 3** — Content usefulness pre-filter (filters out template meta-skills)\n- **Phase 4** — Mirroring bijection check (source↔projection integrity)\n- **Phase 5** — Template duplication detection (MD5 hash clustering)\n\n### Predictions for Day-03\n6 testable predictions registered (P1–P6) — if ≥3 are falsified, the trend model should be revised.","success":true,"task_id":"36820d72-8c2e-452e-85b7-cbb9a3f2b372"}

